&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Principal Software Engineer (Product Validation and Support) to join our Engineering team. This is a hybrid role based in San Jose, CA (3 days a week in office), reporting to the Senior Director, Software Development Engineering. You will be the bridge between customer support and engineering for the Zero Trust for Workloads (Cloud Connector) and Zscaler Microsegmentation products, providing a deep understanding of end-to-end product features. You’ll be responsible for addressing and driving all customer-facing issues and cloud incidents to resolution while ensuring product enablement is seamless.&lt;/p&gt;
