&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;We’re hiring a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;General Manager &lt;/strong&gt;at our rental facility in Idaho Falls, ID, and we’re looking for someone who’s ready to grow with us, bring energy and drive to their work, and help us build the future of construction.&lt;/p&gt;
