&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Awarding-winning adult and pediatric Simulation labs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
