&lt;li&gt;4-6 years of strategic experience as an HR Business Partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Human Resource Management, or related field, or equivalent work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to understand business goals and recommend strategies that help the business achieve them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate strategically while also managing detailed work such as headcount tracking and planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resiliency, critical thinking, and the ability to thrive in a fast-paced, complex, and ever-changing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, organizational, and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to convey messaging from senior leaders to employees effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving employee engagement and business outcomes through thoughtful HR partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
