&lt;p data-start=&quot;559&quot; data-end=&quot;668&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;559&quot; data-end=&quot;572&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; New York, NY&lt;br data-start=&quot;585&quot; data-end=&quot;588&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;588&quot; data-end=&quot;605&quot;&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt; $60,000–$76,000 per year (based on education and experience)&lt;/p&gt;
